<article class="env-definition" id="05AT">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/05AT">Definition <span data-tag="05AT">31.7.1</span>.</a> Let $f : X \to S$ be a morphism of schemes. Let $\mathcal{F}$ be a quasi-coherent $\mathcal{O}_ X$-module. The <em>relative assassin of $\mathcal{F}$ in $X$ over $S$</em> is the set </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  \text{Ass}_{X/S}(\mathcal{F}) = \bigcup \nolimits _{s \in S} \text{Ass}_{X_ s}(\mathcal{F}_ s)  \]
</div>
  <p> where $\mathcal{F}_ s = (X_ s \to X)^*\mathcal{F}$ is the restriction of $\mathcal{F}$ to the fibre of $f$ at $s$. </p>
</article>